  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I don't know how much this happens to other people, but sometimes when I want to join a world a friend is in, I'll accidentally hit invite instead at first and then ill join in, sometimes they ignore it, other times they accept my accidental invite and join the world I'm in, and then I'll have to explain what happened. Maybe a sort of message when you click on the invite button would help that. Something on the lines of \"<username> will be invited to the world you are currently in. Proceed?\" with a yes or no option.",
